{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "585a2dba743a720199fff2a33fbfbe31b7eeeaee16f11bf56de990aefa35fbec", "ja": "お姫さまたちの秘密", "zh": "公主们的秘密", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5c2e95d8ad3235f1f54230b5bf2feecf6f0fc6a9b806276833906a9cda4f6b20", "ja": "百合子のように表現力を身につけ、\n公演でお客さんに喜んでもらいたいと\n決意する未来達。再び行った記者会見ごっこ\nで語った将来の夢を、それぞれ分かち合い\n合宿は佳境をむかえる。", "zh": "未来等人决定效法百合子，培养表现力，\n让来看公演的观众都能尽兴而归。\n她们再次玩起了记者会的游戏，\n向彼此分享未来的梦想。\n整个集训渐入佳境。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_1000_029umi", "source_sha256": "7ffadf6eaeb6be7878d2c5545f63c71af42ada43775dd5ab18cb80aa57e73458", "ja": "ええっー！\nまつりん、なおーたちと銭湯に行ったの！？", "zh": "咦咦～！\n茉茉，你和奈绪～她们一起去了澡堂！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "ad84015491e73f504f33612adf7695bfdc173a35afb9b0fe0fd25913be112285", "ja": "はいなのです。みんなでぽかぽか、\nリフレッシュできたのです♪", "zh": "是的喔。大家一起泡得暖呼呼，\n好好充电了一番的唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "9d049299ff8e0c8f606c3491d31ac7d1bbf288018460bccd368ddf993a1c2059", "ja": "いいな～。私もみんなと一緒にお風呂入りたい！\nゆりりんも、銭湯いきたいよね？", "zh": "好羡慕喔～我想也和大家一起泡澡！\n百合合也想去澡堂对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "48bb44420b0e6be5172f71de2e9aa3edf29803ae943a5af72569d5e8082ac570", "ja": "えっ？　う、うん、ちょっと恥ずかしいけど……。\nあっ、未来もいくよね？", "zh": "咦？呃、嗯，虽然有点难为情……\n啊，未来也会去吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "0954741c8747badf88ff1b41c2109fac0d17e9479f74895a1e61fac249a3e5c5", "ja": "うんっ！\nみんなでお風呂なんて、修学旅行みたいだよね～♪", "zh": "嗯！\n大家一起泡澡，感觉就像毕业旅行一样呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "afa0bc161086270fd19dc5b291b09615c8f148d6bc8ad00b4df7e9f257e00d6f", "ja": "決まりなのです！　今日もレッスンが終わったら、\nぽかぽかふわふわの銭湯デイなのです♪", "zh": "决定了喔！今天的课程结束以后，\n一样也是暖呼呼软绵绵的澡堂日的唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ec2f56df48b0ad59801d44f5e2fb76d3a3043d4215526ce2b2da16beac261598", "ja": "じゃ、夕ご飯もそれに合わせるかな。\nでも、今はとりあえず、午後のレッスンに集中だ！", "zh": "那晚餐就配合洗澡时间吧。\n不过，现在要先集中精神在下午的课程上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "5c898d723c86b08169b21b0702f325d9359948e9aeb066aa6fb10bd8442d7d4e", "ja": "は～い！（なのです！）", "zh": "好～！（的喔！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "3f3f2a97db294c531013c4a22f6b20a34404295c0ff263be380020c749d01d1d", "ja": "は～い！", "zh": "好的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "3f3f2a97db294c531013c4a22f6b20a34404295c0ff263be380020c749d01d1d", "ja": "は～い！", "zh": "好的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "3f3f2a97db294c531013c4a22f6b20a34404295c0ff263be380020c749d01d1d", "ja": "は～い！", "zh": "好的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_1011_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_1012_lesson", "source_sha256": "49f138fc3a9ed93c79b4772c65716a221fe550a3a45df4e6a5c09328513d436d", "ja": "みんな、だいぶ上達してきたわね。\n特に……七尾さん！", "zh": "大家表现得越来越棒了。\n尤其是……七尾小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "c447da8b978e47a333b211cbe824088b99d150998098739a0511efaa4d4bccb8", "ja": "はいっ！　な、なんでしょう？", "zh": "是！怎、怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_1014_lesson", "source_sha256": "0febc0f78b3aba5f44e812fba649397aa99632cc94e80710dbef5a02ad44a654", "ja": "七尾さんの歌からは、奥行きを感じたわ。きっと\n表現力があるのね。このまま伸ばしていきましょう！", "zh": "七尾小姐的歌声让我感受到了深度。一定是因为\n你的表现力很好，要继续加强这点喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "7e83d9987f5e2685f7293d4ad5fccd2cb724030c81e6bd49137efb15589bbbe8", "ja": "わぁ……。\nあ、ありがとうございますっ！", "zh": "哇……\n谢、谢谢老师的夸奖！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_1016_lesson", "source_sha256": "17c09b15b535e35976a0a9038bbac8fc91805f5fb0ea6c77a525db6bf544746c", "ja": "それじゃ、次の曲にいきましょう。\nはいみんな、位置に戻って！", "zh": "那么，换下一首歌吧。\n来，所有人各就各位！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "06d6ef17350c889d23f46e38cd5a68795b1fa36c1d05cdbeffd7f037bbd1b583", "ja": "ねえねえゆりりん、\nさっきのレッスン、すごかったね！", "zh": "欸欸，百合合，\n刚才上课的时候，你好厉害喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "b6408b133be5e300a287e94a7659b2badab6c845805ed243c03f83ed895fd535", "ja": "まつりも、隣で歌を聞いていて、\n思わずうるうるだったのです。", "zh": "茉莉在旁边听你唱歌，\n也是不由自主就被感动到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "2056a26755ca07625345f53ef7092240122412e876cdab6d39f6ad2902908d5d", "ja": "私も百合子みたいなヒョーゲンリョク欲しいな～。\nねえねえ、どうすればいいの？", "zh": "我也想要有百合子那样的表现力～\n欸欸，这要怎么培养呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "5a8ba422537ec939d48ecdc89d94130d9b6c7d8f04f13a14f3c77210de202f51", "ja": "ええっ！？　ど、どうすればって言われても……。\n私、自分の何が良かったのか、よくわからなくて……。", "zh": "咦咦！？就、就算你这么问……\n我也不晓得自己到底是哪里好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_1021_p", "source_sha256": "2c86b1a42124fee2bfd1ee36fbee25f00154c867eb4a72b6366b87a8f0c3ca65", "ja": "百合子、それはひょっとしたら……", "zh": "百合子，那说不定……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_1022", "source_sha256": "280793a995a7d56d7e4fefe376281ec2e58feafb9287b25af2710744c0c38a5c", "ja": "読書の成果", "zh": "阅读的成果", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2000_p", "source_sha256": "638d06caa07c71dec4d31041d2c0bbacb00f47f00f2a8486d7c0bd8f1a29f52b", "ja": "読書の成果じゃないかな。たくさん本を読んでいる\nことが、表現力に繋がってるんだと思う。", "zh": "是你平日阅读的成果呢。\n应该是你饱读诗书，才造就了现在的表现力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2001_026yur", "source_sha256": "e083a4b80c509b4a67aec95c58d22a12e7046eca320e897853bffac698ef1aa4", "ja": "本を……。たしかに私、本はたくさん読んでます。\nそうなのかな？", "zh": "阅读……我是看过不少书没错，\n但真的是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2002_014mir", "source_sha256": "bdab1d8db9e8a76f0e3a7e876eae0a3ca693b8b3291ee69a069689dc53b2c41e", "ja": "きっとそれだよ！\nでも、なんで本を読むといいの？", "zh": "一定是啦！\n不过，为什么看书会有帮助呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2003_026yur", "source_sha256": "ed0ce0a8f189e46a8889b2442f3caece2aba3504e9cebb4ba16c0ca5421f593c", "ja": "う～ん……。もしかしたら、登場人物の気持ちとか、\n本の世界の空気を、いつも想像してるからかも！", "zh": "唔～嗯……说不定是因为我会去思考登场人物的\n内心感受等等，平常就在想像这类书中世界的氛围呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2004_029umi", "source_sha256": "6355ce17774facacfaededa78ccad1195652b1669297db2b0363f2eda0252dde", "ja": "気持ちとか、世界の空気……。\n大変っ、むずかしそう！", "zh": "内心感受、世界的氛围……\n天啊！好像很难！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2005_021mat", "source_sha256": "394f77146aaed011c71b82c31e2b3105f3056bc3fc74b581e2eb005a932f22c3", "ja": "はいほー！\nそれなら、ちょうどいい物があるのです！", "zh": "Hi Ho！\n这样的话，有个东西正好派得上用场的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2006_014mir", "source_sha256": "2330803881ad224f3a6df7bf0a1e3a4aab8b2e64127ed3706006328b3bbcd536", "ja": "なになに、まつりちゃん？", "zh": "什么什么，茉莉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2007_021mat", "source_sha256": "081d06485daffa3f91851dd03564d086fc288113c9164994b04e8175eb5d166e", "ja": "まつりが一番大好きな少女漫画なのです。\nいつも枕元にあるのを、持ってきてるのですよ♪", "zh": "是茉莉最喜欢的少女漫画的喔。\n茉莉把平时的睡前读物带过来了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2008_021mat", "source_sha256": "5b1c3333c31b80069fd5338512168247fa593493fefba296c9936ce6c30846f4", "ja": "あれを読めば、うるうるな恋の表現力が身につくこと、\n間違いなしなのです♪", "zh": "只要读了那些，肯定能培养出\n感动人心的恋爱表现力♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2009_014mir", "source_sha256": "a69e57e0f8e51c19b0221e92ab6869650e6294cb379c6e03520801c725cc03fa", "ja": "わあ、面白そー！\nまつりちゃんっ、読ませて読ませて～！", "zh": "哇，好像很有趣～！\n茉莉，借我看借我看～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2010_021mat", "source_sha256": "d33548af4a979cdeab8939d2c91dc8f48a91e839a6be67fe858d7ddc8d19c40e", "ja": "はいなのです！\n全42巻、もれなく読み放題なのです♪", "zh": "好的喔！\n全部42集，想怎么看就怎么看的喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2011_p", "source_sha256": "df8c1c411ab57b54efab25573c222866fb878ac5039a9891c08ff93f52b25c71", "ja": "（……読み切れるのか？）", "zh": "（……看得完吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2012_026yur", "source_sha256": "4b876e9942b88907a632831e0c81ac9803668bbfee455d4be88c0ba013ae0b90", "ja": "あの、それなら私にも、\n今の愛読書を紹介させてください！", "zh": "那个，这样的话，\n也让我来介绍一下现在喜欢看的书！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2013_026yur", "source_sha256": "526b1496faee6228a2d50da8faf266bfec0e8a9ff26670ddecdfdc58cef2a93f", "ja": "和風のファンタジーものなんですけど、主人公の子狐が\nお姫様の替え玉になっちゃう冒険活劇なんです。", "zh": "这是和风的奇幻类作品，内容是讲述主角小狐狸\n成了公主替身的冒险故事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2014_026yur", "source_sha256": "760ed154e12dbd8222b0ae093740bab8860025a30c11c217b8f3ffa5cbdc45df", "ja": "正体がばれないかいつもハラハラしながら、若宮様との\n恋あり、ライバルとの駆け引きありで……！", "zh": "平时要一直提心吊胆会不会被拆穿身分，\n一方面还有跟皇子之间的爱恋、劲敌之间的过招……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2015_029umi", "source_sha256": "1762dc92a2616cc1fc97773557e2533edd3bfc99021340cafd087486d94b92ba", "ja": "わぁ、なんか面白そう！　ねえねえゆりりん、\n私が持ってきた本と交換で、読みあいっこしようよ！", "zh": "哇，好像很有趣！欸欸，百合合，\n我用自己带的书跟你交换，一起看书吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2016_026yur", "source_sha256": "0556579d969d8210b4bad18a481abe263fd83d88d6cd0d15118919bbe50a356c", "ja": "はい、ぜひ……！\n海美さんのは、どんな本なんですか？", "zh": "好，请借我看……！\n海美带的是怎样的书呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2017_029umi", "source_sha256": "43e9c90c362e1ae4b0313f7b527a194cd7af22ad18c04806e3bfb2c6d98dff68", "ja": "『女子力が高まる柔軟シリーズ　ザ・開脚』！\nゆりりんにもぴったりだと思うよ！", "zh": "《提升女子力的柔软操系列　The 劈腿》！\n这本书肯定也很适合百合合喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2019_029umi", "source_sha256": "923d0bc6544959b03372e9f5d2165708d748685f8ca15831c0a8412288039b06", "ja": "本の通りにストレッチしてから、女子力がぐーんって\nあがった気がするの！　これも想像力ってやつだよね！", "zh": "照着书本的内容做柔软操以后，我觉得自己的\n女子力有明显成长喔！这也是托想像力的福对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2020_021mat", "source_sha256": "02b413b75f18ac20f281f726a414ea6f71b25e3be1c9ffa483b7ce11e6250c4e", "ja": "それはなにか違うと思うのです。", "zh": "茉莉觉得不太一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2021_029umi", "source_sha256": "214f2b4b7bbda77c99ff67089dbf5350bea703923b232f2146ca5a5c6385a988", "ja": "えっ、そうなの！？", "zh": "咦！是这样吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2022_p", "source_sha256": "b484f7ad75b6fea5d55b373f35ba32398066cda688eb7ae75e542ef03695d714", "ja": "話がそれて来てるぞ。……よし、ためしに今から\n想像力と表現力のレッスンをしてみないか？", "zh": "话题越扯越远了……好，你们接下来\n要不要试试看想像力与表现力的训练课程？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2023_014mir", "source_sha256": "e71d947e2aa3154bfc8ecc5d8d5802d98ffdd6a3d59b2c695a19c3d31400b4d8", "ja": "想像力と表現力のレッスン？\nどうするんですか？", "zh": "想像力与表现力的训练课程？\n要怎么做才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2024_p", "source_sha256": "c2f43b3f24a9a4b8b661781f214e0c155edf9c215a3ee325061e7cd1aefc382d", "ja": "まずは想像してみて欲しいんだ。\nPrincess公演を、力いっぱいやりきって……。", "zh": "首先我要你们去想像在Princess公演上，\n用尽全力使出浑身解数……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2025_p", "source_sha256": "ffdd42c590b61b11b1011b6378b7f83295dc87527fbea6e4dd723b5a79f883e9", "ja": "その後、自分がどんな気持ちになっているか。\nどんな夢をみているか。それを言葉にしてみようか。", "zh": "结束之后自己感觉如何、\n有什么样的愿景，试着把这些说出口吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2026_014mir", "source_sha256": "2d3fb561f245e0ba0d03123e58cab5d2244da58cb02a171fa1321ee2be4a4c9a", "ja": "想像して言葉にですか？\nえっと～？", "zh": "想像之后再说出口是吗？\n我想想～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2027_021mat", "source_sha256": "4c2cf35530f137f919c88e98e75d166d3786b386ba5b8332e661cd82988363ab", "ja": "ここは姫にお任せなのです！　そういうのは、\nインタビュー形式が一番なのです。……ね？", "zh": "这里就交给公主吧！这种事情，\n最适合以采访形式进行的喔……呐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2028_p", "source_sha256": "1daa11004c54b3c51ccd0f3abf925633b2a24c6b49eca174b29b10bb02c4af06", "ja": "おっ、なるほどな。\nよし、まつり、よろしく頼む！", "zh": "喔，好提议。\n好，茉莉，麻烦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2029_021mat", "source_sha256": "ecd7eb330f490bd1f04b4a30045f3aba1de24f966d2f5a25635ffbac5343e928", "ja": "はいほー！　早速ですが、Princess公演を終えて\n……まずは一言なのです、未来ちゃん♪", "zh": "Hi Ho！那就直接来了，Princess公演结束以后……\n请先发表一句感言，小未来♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2030_014mir", "source_sha256": "d68815e5cb6130c18116759f59f80e5488711978d5f79f5ff9275d7c933feb4c", "ja": "え？　あ、はい！\nえっと、Princess公演が終わって～、終わって～。", "zh": "咦？啊，好的！\n我想想，Princess公演结束以后～结束以后～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2031_014mir", "source_sha256": "ed944aa5e85ff1fd29851f00fbe8dc176330d3b3d2ca6328f5dcc8651bfb60e2", "ja": "い、いっぱいレッスンした成果が、ちゃんと\n出せてると……。ううん、出せたと思います！", "zh": "我、我想我们在公演上，应该有充分展现出\n练习的成果……不，是确实展现出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2032_021mat", "source_sha256": "3e6bcf336bfc1c1b0a7e1468ed77e404e6e4e846a6ec4c8bf9030ae302f228b4", "ja": "なるほどなのです！\nでは、これからの目標はあるのです？", "zh": "原来是这样的喔！\n那么，你今后有什么目标吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2033_014mir", "source_sha256": "b93b2f51319c11f4a7481febd04b444ab97183395be0aff62fc746b09cdb966a", "ja": "はい！　これからも、もっともーっと、ファンの\nみんなを笑顔にできるアイドルになりたいです！", "zh": "有的！从今以后，我也会继续努力，\n希望能成为让更多粉丝露出笑容的偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2034_026yur", "source_sha256": "82af103aaea46c2d25d1f474c02932425c2465f04f73ec30ffc64ce3db0628f6", "ja": "おお～。", "zh": "哦哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2035_029umi", "source_sha256": "82af103aaea46c2d25d1f474c02932425c2465f04f73ec30ffc64ce3db0628f6", "ja": "おお～。", "zh": "哦哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2036_021mat", "source_sha256": "b5e2982fe53eb3c87fe215d99b3935eb2152eddf04909b1921d25f2e81b5531c", "ja": "次は、百合子ちゃん。お疲れさまなのです！\nすばらしい公演だったのです。", "zh": "接着是小百合子。辛苦你了！\n公演真是精采呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2037_026yur", "source_sha256": "acbc869401c5fb71b02aee20b9d75f9eb5667930dee98ff97ed5b714a16af4c2", "ja": "あ、はいっ！　あ、ありがとうございます……。\nえっと……。今の自分を出し切れたと思いますっ。", "zh": "啊，是！谢、谢谢你的夸奖……\n呃……我觉得有表现出目前最好的自己了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2038_021mat", "source_sha256": "c2b8e5a22578d96b374db9b3418a7e243676f9ebdff365e5919b502b77c38279", "ja": "公演をやりとげた今、これから百合子ちゃんは\nどんなアイドルを目指すのです？", "zh": "公演圆满落幕之后，\n小百合子今后想成为怎样的偶像呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2039_026yur", "source_sha256": "dbe2bd705bede870c8fa9adfda055e040df4066f132cb7afed6747fecd6fb65f", "ja": "この公演をやりとげた後、私は……。また見たい、\nもっと一緒に冒険したいって思ってもらえる……。", "zh": "结束这场公演之后，我……想成为\n让人更好奇、更想加入一起冒险……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2040_026yur", "source_sha256": "35461f061b3ef456ad0dc070532de457c599349ccfd1aec7f4e9640c02b31db4", "ja": "そんな、物語の主人公のような\nアイドルになりたいですっ！", "zh": "那种有如故事主角般的偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2041_029umi", "source_sha256": "aac6b832ed9cc6c88a016fad555002062d2ca9a50a5132457dbd4f80cb94af5c", "ja": "おお～！", "zh": "哦哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2042_014mir", "source_sha256": "aac6b832ed9cc6c88a016fad555002062d2ca9a50a5132457dbd4f80cb94af5c", "ja": "おお～！", "zh": "哦哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2043_021mat", "source_sha256": "000d0d47f1f6537cd7b921a43a91fa7476457a2736ab2036c740b8221de112be", "ja": "では、海美ちゃんの番なのです。\nとても印象的なステージだったのです。", "zh": "那么，接下来轮到小海美了。\n真是让人印象深刻的表演呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2044_029umi", "source_sha256": "687685ab112f64289f4401026528792c9a1b35635628c55da2a93f7854386371", "ja": "は、はい！　えっとね……。全力で走ったり泳いだり\nしたあとみたいに、すっごく気持ちよかったです！", "zh": "是、是的！这个嘛……感觉就像是\n尽全力跑完步、游完泳一样，心情非常地畅快！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2045_021mat", "source_sha256": "1981b6f1a19c33d14f65dd3024a7741853180fbea796ac984bcbfee676484c0f", "ja": "次に、どんなことに挑戦して、\nゆくゆくはどんなアイドルを目指すのです？", "zh": "接下来会做些什么挑战？\n想以怎样的偶像为目标呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2046_029umi", "source_sha256": "7c692d4db23c4717770856202d2f6e5e725016cdcf42e02081ea6de5d3be961b", "ja": "私……。私は……。\n私は、ずーっとステージに出ていたいな！", "zh": "我……我想……\n我想一直站上舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2047_029umi", "source_sha256": "695cd3bee6f574e0438bc12858740eaf71913b61fcc5f6b3264e29be06736477", "ja": "それでね、ファンのみんなを、ずーっと元気にするの。\nそんなアイドルになりたいです！", "zh": "然后呀，一直将活力送给台下的粉丝们。\n我想成为这样的偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2048_014mir", "source_sha256": "47418f026e026bc8b40d62de7584f1edc79d2b6a5be64f496485cd7b12d4a212", "ja": "すてきー！", "zh": "好帅气──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2049_026yur", "source_sha256": "47418f026e026bc8b40d62de7584f1edc79d2b6a5be64f496485cd7b12d4a212", "ja": "すてきー！", "zh": "好帅气──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2050_021mat", "source_sha256": "838708cb49b0593bbb9fc761d6bfde46a1befa173810ab828cce878b7e79fbcd", "ja": "わんだほー！　みんなありがとうなのです！\n3人とも、気持ちがたくさんこもっていたのです。", "zh": "真是美妙──！谢谢各位接受采访的唷！\n三个人都有表达出自己的心意呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2051_p", "source_sha256": "15cc3265851ddd3c4e129c833fa120c9f0c61051b09acacde7fa95b35e5881ea", "ja": "ああ、ばっちり表現できていたと思うぞ。\nみんなの今の夢も、形になったみたいだし。", "zh": "是啊，我觉得你们都有把自己的想法表现出来喔。\n大家现在的梦想，似乎也有个雏形了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2052_014mir", "source_sha256": "787e0d1d94f933c6965725a36970bd72321840e9e88eada711ffd72794931526", "ja": "百合子と海美さん、そんな夢を持ってたんだねっ。\n私、聞いてるだけでドキドキしてきちゃった！", "zh": "原来百合子和海美有那种梦想！\n我光是在旁边听就觉得心情好激动呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2053_026yur", "source_sha256": "45da9bda14aa6f31050783474eafb7d1c07af606a4f49e6bf6f30f473dcb16e4", "ja": "未来こそ。一緒に、夢に向かってがんばろうね！\n海美さんも！", "zh": "未来才是，让我们一起朝着梦想加油吧！\n还有海美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2054_029umi", "source_sha256": "f1180522dafcaf6ecab4532fefe6d7cfeea59d3c35c9be359df9241289a3535a", "ja": "うんうん！　ありがとう、まつりん。\nなんか、すっごくやる気がわいてきたよ！", "zh": "嗯嗯！谢谢你，茉茉！\n总觉得干劲十足呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2055_021mat", "source_sha256": "c78dabe3f1cd397ef5ddc79af8d2ca67112999b829c130819b6730ce3872db14", "ja": "みんな、夢や目標がいっぱいなのです。\nそしてその願いはきっと……。", "zh": "大家都有各自的梦想与目标。\n而这些心愿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2056_021mat", "source_sha256": "0f271e5bc746c6e78305581496a48a856dabc95bcba228de3a2d45fc75cdcd20", "ja": "{$P$}さんが、\n全部かなえてくれるのです♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生\n肯定会帮茉莉我们全部实现的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2057_p", "source_sha256": "7f68a43a7e0d0cac7288a9ba0312d81ac27e9decab34536e61bc11ceba695021", "ja": "お、おいおい……。頼りにしてくれるのは\nうれしいけどひとつだけ、忘れないでくれよ。", "zh": "喂、喂喂……我是很高兴你们愿意依赖我，\n但可别忘了一件事喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2058_p", "source_sha256": "266f7bad6d3e182c86625e2aee4b284e2e333948e117d0a78d3a97260ffd7d1c", "ja": "夢をかなえるのは、みんな自身。\n俺にできるのは、その手助けだけだ。", "zh": "能够实现梦想的，就只有你们自己。\n我能做的只是在一旁辅助而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2059_p", "source_sha256": "8255548855fcaf51314d06822d3c3af64f0f0c501f939f5af83b4166952ca6ff", "ja": "でも、確かにみんなの夢は、受け取った。\nこれから一緒に、一つずつ、かなえて行こう！", "zh": "不过，我确实收到了大家的梦想。\n从今以后，就让我们一个一个去实现吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2060_014mir", "source_sha256": "5c898d723c86b08169b21b0702f325d9359948e9aeb066aa6fb10bd8442d7d4e", "ja": "は～い！（なのです！）", "zh": "好～！（的喔！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2061_021mat", "source_sha256": "3c568b29f7987cb3717e5520d9c2646c5a434b0b70bab56b196eff3c47c3c120", "ja": "は～い、なのです！", "zh": "好～的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2062_026yur", "source_sha256": "3f3f2a97db294c531013c4a22f6b20a34404295c0ff263be380020c749d01d1d", "ja": "は～い！", "zh": "好的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2063_029umi", "source_sha256": "3f3f2a97db294c531013c4a22f6b20a34404295c0ff263be380020c749d01d1d", "ja": "は～い！", "zh": "好的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2064_p", "source_sha256": "e936037158dc6730fd066cdddaf9b53b21bc3dad3a413d79c7ab0d4839c099be", "ja": "（それぞれの夢を共有して、高め合う……。\n合宿をした意味が、見えてきたな）", "zh": "（分享彼此的梦想，相互砥砺……\n总算看到这次集训的意义了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_04_2065_p", "source_sha256": "e0714b295fe45aaef3d236feaef0289368094e9687a256fac21023c284807342", "ja": "（それじゃ、そろそろ銭湯に向かうとするか！）", "zh": "（那么，也是时候该去澡堂了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
